 "doctrine": "ADR-039 Mode A; every repair is source-page-supported typography (digit VALUES unchanged); the replacer is fail-closed — any candidate token absent from this ledger ABORTS the run; guard classes resolve per occurrence (adjacent charge sign -> ion; '(' -> formula; detached charge -> skip+log)",
 "sign_convention": "digits after element symbols -> subscripts; trailing charge -> superscript; coefficients stay flat; bracket multipliers after ')' subscript",
 "withhold_families": [
  "isotopes (73Li/6Li/7Li/24Mg/25Mg/26Mg/20Ne/22Ne/19F/18F/35Cl/37Cl/Cl35Cl/Cl37Cl/37Cl37Cl/37Cl35Cl/Cu-/Mg-) — superscript-prefix repositioning needs page evidence (Mode C)",
  "MS-quoted wrong-answer formulas (KSO4/N2Mg3/NH3CO3/NH4CO3/2CH4COO/MgCL2) — the text QUOTES a wrong answer; repairing would falsify the quote",
  "sign-first ALLOW variants (Al+/Cu+/Na+/2S2/2SO42/Mg+)",
  "garbled/typo tokens (MgFl2/NH41/H3O/YH2O/F2Z/ZF2/F2Mg/CH3CH/CHCH2CH3)",
  "spaced-equation fragments (H4/H6/H8/2C2/3H7OH)",
  "bond dashes (C-/H-/O-/Br-/Cl-) and method bullets",
  "prose noise (3D/2D/U-/M1-/1SF/J-values/answer references)"
